    ##
    ## ## Memory
    ## Nothing is leaked: every raylib buffer this wrapper allocates or receives is released before returning.
    ##
    ## ## Example
    ## ```pengu
    ## calling img.crop with (with x is 0.0, y is 0.0, width is 32.0, height is 32.0)
    ## ```

    weave crop with rect as raylib.Rectangle into void:
        calling raylib.ImageCrop with self, rect

