    ## Applies a Gaussian blur.
    ##
    ## ## Parameters
    ## - `blur_size`: the blur radius in pixels
    ##
    ## ## Returns
    ## Nothing; the image is changed in place.
    ##
    ## ## Notes
    ## A larger `blur_size` is slower; the cost grows with the square of the radius.
    ##
    ## ## Memory
    ## Nothing is leaked: every raylib buffer this wrapper allocates or receives is released before returning.
    ##
